ci</surname><given-names>BC</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2008</year><volume>5</volume><issue>4</issue><article-title>Characteristics of young women who gave birth in the US-Mexico border region, 2005: the Brownsville-Matamoros Sister City Project for Women's Health</article-title><source>Prev Chronic Dis</source><fpage>A120</fpage><comment><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.cdc.gov/pcd/issues/2008/oct/08_0060.htm">http://www.cdc.gov/pcd/issues/2008/oct/08_0060.htm</ext-link></comment><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18793508</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><label>9</label><citation citation-type="web"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Castrucci</surname><given-names>BC</given-names></name><name><surname>Echegollen Guzm&#x000e1;n</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Saraiya</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Smith</surname><given-names>BR</given-names></name><name><surname>Lewis</surname><given-names>KL</given-names></name><name><surname>Coughlin</surname><given-names>SS</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2008</year><volume>5</volume><issue>4</issue><article-title>Cervical cancer screening among women who gave birth in the US-Mexico border region, 2005: the Brownsville-Matamoros Sister City Project for Women's Health</article-title><source>Prev Chronic Dis</source><fpage>A116</fpage><comment><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.cdc.gov/pcd/issues/2008/oct/08_0063.htm">http://www.cdc.gov/pcd/issues/2008/oct/08_0063.htm</ext-link></comment><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18793504</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><label>10</label><citation citation-type="web"><source>US-Mexico Border Health Association</source><access-date>Accessed June 30, 2008</access-date><comment><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.usmbha.org/">http://www.usmbha.org/</ext-link></comment></citation></ref></ref-list><fn-group><fn><p>The opinions expres